<title>USA: IPI Inc lands supply contract in Poland.</title>
<headline>IPI Inc lands supply contract in Poland.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPI Inc, franchiser of Insty-Prints fast-turnaround business printing centers, said Thursday it completed an agreement to be the exclusive wholesale printing supplier for all Office Depot Inc stores in Poland.</p>
<p>The agreement was made through IPI's Master Franchisee for Insty-Prints in Poland. Insty-Prints will supply all of Office Depot Poland's printing needs that they cannot perform internally.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
